## Funciones puras sugeridas

```ts
calculateSquare(side)
calculateRectangle(base, height)
calculateTriangleFromSides(a, b, c)
calculateTriangleAreaFromBaseHeight(base, height)
calculateCircle(radius)
calculateCircleFromDiameter(diameter)
calculateRegularPolygon(sideCount, sideLength)
getRegularPolygonName(sideCount)
parseMeasurement(value)
validatePositiveMeasurement(value)
formatLinearMeasurement(value, unit, decimals)
formatAreaMeasurement(value, unit, decimals)
formatMeasurementAuto(value, maxDecimals)
```

